The tables in data/derived/ are derived from the sample traces and what-if
results in "StragglerAnalysis", the artifact for the paper "Understanding
Stragglers in Large Model Training Using What-if Analysis" (ByteDance Seed,
OSDI 2025).

  Source:  https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/StragglerAnalysis
  License: Apache License 2.0 (copy in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt)

Changes made: per-operation trace rows were summed into per-rank, per-step
compute times and a forward-versus-backward correlation. Trace SE was reduced
to the first four data-parallel replicas of each pipeline stage. The what-if
result files were trimmed to the slowdown fields this project uses. The
conversion script is scripts/prepare_traces.py.

